  "label": "Mueller Report",
  "description": "The special counsel investigation led by Robert Mueller, appointed by the U.S. Department of Justice in 2017 to investigate Russian interference in the 2016 U.S. presidential election and any potential collusion with the Trump campaign. The report was released in April 2019 and concluded there was no evidence of a criminal conspiracy between the Trump campaign and Russia, though it found obstruction of justice by President Trump.",
